    "cards": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "html": "Working with a protection dog means working in situations where things can go wrong quickly — for the dog, and sometimes for the handler. Medical preparedness isn't an afterthought in that context, it's part of taking the responsibility seriously.",
            "class": null
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "html": "SafariMedic's kits stood out to me for the same reason I care about training the way I do: they're built for real conditions, not just a checklist. That's the standard I hold my own work to, and it's why I point clients toward them rather than a generic first-aid kit.",
            "class": null
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "html": "This isn't a paid endorsement dressed up as advice — I recommend them because I'd want a client to have the right kit on hand if something happens, and I haven't found a better option for this kind of work.",
            "class": null
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
